; Tauri's own installer strings (the pages and messages of its NSIS template) in Simplified Chinese, in place of Tauri's
; file: `bundle.windows.nsis.customLanguageFiles` in tauri.conf.json points here. Tauri's file (CLI 2.12.3) puts "older"
; where a version number goes ("版本为 旧的 的"), says 你 where PerMark says 您, and has literal {{product_name}}
; placeholders. Same names as Tauri's English.nsh (2.12.4 renamed choowHowToInstall to chooseHowToInstall: both are
; here, same words). Tauri copies the file as it is and adds the byte order mark itself, so the file has none; the
; product name is ${PRODUCTNAME}.
LangString addOrReinstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "添加或重新安装组件"
LangString alreadyInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装"
LangString alreadyInstalledLong ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${PRODUCTNAME} ${VERSION} 已经安装。请选择您要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”继续。"
LangString appRunning ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${PRODUCTNAME} 正在运行。请先关闭它，然后重试。"
LangString appRunningOkKill ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "${PRODUCTNAME} 正在运行。$\n点击“确定”以结束它。"
LangString chooseMaintenanceOption ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择要执行的维护操作。"
LangString chooseHowToInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择安装 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的方式。"
LangString choowHowToInstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "请选择安装 ${PRODUCTNAME} 的方式。"
LangString createDesktop ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "创建桌面快捷方式"
LangString dontUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "不卸载"
LangString dontUninstallDowngrade ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "不卸载（此安装程序不允许在未卸载的情况下降级）"
LangString failedToKillApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法结束 ${PRODUCTNAME}。请先关闭它，然后重试。"
LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在安装 WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "已安装更新版本的 ${PRODUCTNAME}。不建议安装旧版本。如果您确实要安装此旧版本，最好先卸载当前版本。请选择您要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”继续。"
LangString older ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "较旧"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "系统中已安装$R4版本的 ${PRODUCTNAME}。建议先卸载当前版本，再进行安装。请选择您要执行的操作，然后点击“下一步”继续。"
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "此安装程序不允许降级，无法继续静默安装。请改用图形界面安装程序。$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法卸载。"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "卸载 ${PRODUCTNAME}"
LangString uninstallBeforeInstalling ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "安装前先卸载"
LangString unknown ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "未知"
LangString webview2AbortError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "无法安装 WebView2。没有它，此应用无法运行。请尝试重新启动安装程序。"
LangString webview2DownloadError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "错误：无法下载 WebView2 - $0"
LangString webview2DownloadSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 引导程序下载成功"
LangString webview2Downloading ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "正在下载 WebView2 引导程序..."
LangString webview2InstallError ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "错误：安装 WebView2 失败，退出代码：$1"
LangString webview2InstallSuccess ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "WebView2 安装成功"
LangString deleteAppData ${LANG_SIMPCHINESE} "删除应用程序数据"
